     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Dyspnea and pleuritic CP; sm pneumothoraces are occasionally aSx; dyspnea may be sudden or gradual depending on the rate of development and size"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Classic exam: "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       },
       {
        "type": "highlight",
        "attrs": {
         "hex": "FF0000"
        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "⍉tactile fremitus, hyperresonance to percussion and ↓breath sounds"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " on the affected side; if lrg, the affected side may be enlrg w the trach shifted to the opposite side, and breath sounds may be ⍉"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
